  "quirks": [
    "Category tabs are icon-only (inline SVG); the category name exists only in each tab's aria-label. No category heading is shown on the menu.",
    "Grid shows 6 items per page (3x2). Pager arrows ◀ / ▶ are clickable divs with a '1 / 2' indicator; switching tabs resets to page 1. 팝콘 page 2: 반반 팝콘, 트러플 팝콘(품절). 음료 page 2: 아메리카노, 생수.",
    "Sold out (dark '품절' overlay, tap shows error toast '품절된 메뉴입니다.'): 패밀리 콤보, 트러플 팝콘, 자몽에이드. 패밀리 콤보 is also disabled inside the wizard's step 1.",
    "Standalone popcorn base price is the S size; size (S/M/L, +0/+1,000/+2,000) has no default and is required ('사이즈를 선택해 주세요.').",
    "Drink size defaults to R. 아메리카노 also needs HOT/ICE with no default. 슬러시 flavor has no default. 나쵸 sauce, 오징어 seasoning and 텐더 dip have defaults.",
    "Half-and-half: exactly 2 flavors. Picking a 3rd is blocked with '반반은 맛을 2가지까지만 고를 수 있어요.'; fewer than 2 gives '반반 팝콘은 맛을 정확히 2가지 선택해 주세요. (현재 N가지)' on 담기/다음. The chosen flavors never change the price (반반 팝콘 is 6,000원 base; combo 반반 is a flat +1,000원).",
    "Combo wizard opens from any combo card with that combo preselected. Step 1's left button is '취소' (not '이전'); step 5's right button is '장바구니 담기'. Changing the combo on step 1 clears drink picks. The wizard shows a running '현재 금액'.",
    "Combo popcorn is M by default price; L is +1,000원. Combo flavors other than 오리지널 are +500원. Combo drinks: 아이스티 +500원, 레몬에이드 +1,000원 per cup. 2-drink combos use −/+ counters that must total exactly 2 ('음료를 2잔 선택해 주세요.').",
